Use explicit project references, agreement links, scope and chronology to relate each artifact to a contractual milestone. A similar name alone is insufficient. Retain multiple candidates when identity is ambiguous and ask the project owner for a discriminating reference. Record the artifact as draftOnly when it was circulated for comment rather than formally handed over.
